<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωφ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rest, give over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅδε μὲν τάχα λωφήσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.292
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ λωφήσω τρεῖς ὥρας</span>
			dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλωφάω</span>), <i>take rest</i>
			or <i>abate from, recover from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόλου,
				πόθου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				378
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				654
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὀδύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					251
				</span></i>
			 c; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλοτιμίας λελωφηκυῖαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					620c
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀπὸ νόσου καὶ πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c.
			part., <i>cease</i> to do, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρήσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.819
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.187
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>abate</i>, of pain, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				49
			</span></i>; of a disease, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				854c
			</span></i>; of misfortunes, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.77
			</span></i>; of wind, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				362a7
			</span></i>; of the sea, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				934b15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν λωφήσωσιν οἱ λίθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.7.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>lighten, relieve</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λωφήσων γὰρ οὐ πέφυκέ πω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχέων λωφήσετε θυμόν</span>
			<i>relieve</i> your mind <i>from</i> pains, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				145.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
